15:3: tamber-kind: `icon.kind`: an `icons` block holds icon tokens
16:3: tamber-icon-axis: `icon.varies`: an icon has one source per platform, so no `when` (vary the row's symbol instead)
18:19: tamber-kind: an icon has an `sf` or an `svg` source: a `material` name is an annotation, which no host draws
19:17: tamber-kind: `../star.svg`: an SVG is a `.svg` file under the app's `assets/`, by its path there (`icons/reply.svg`)
20:14: tamber-kind: `png`: an icon's sources are `sf`, `material` and `svg`
21:15: tamber-kind: an icon is `icon(sf "…", material "…", svg "…")`
